abstract: "Public landing and metadata refresh for an integrated claim-bounded active-particle feedback surrogate archive. The package preserves the v0.3.1 model and audit synthesis while strengthening public claim-boundary presentation, GitHub Pages support, repository metadata, and manifest consistency. The archived diagnostics concern kinetic-arrest-like behavior, noise-assisted annealing, feedback-geometry dependence, frustration-boundary classification, rescue-stability behavior, and persistent hard boundaries inside tested toy-model settings."
